      ":question/problem": "![](images/1e/1e509f31bd3e7ba83cd22ef52d89a73e3aeb22efb4318f589999b9be6f98a7cc.png)\n\nIn the diagram above, $QR^(\u27f7)\u2225ST^(\u27f7)$.\n\nConsider the following statement:\n\n> $m\u2220\u03b3 + m\u2220\u03b1 + m\u2220\u03b2 = 180^{\u2218}$\n\nThe table below gives the proof of the statement. Select the correct options in the table and thus complete the proof.\n\n|  | Statement | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | $QR^(\u27f7)\u2225ST^(\u27f7)$ | Given |\n| 2 | $m\u2220SPU + m\u2220UPV + m\u2220VPT$<br>$= m\u2220SPT$ | {{field-1}} |\n| 3 | $\u2220SPU\u2245\u2220\u03b3$ | Corresponding angles postulate |\n| 4 | $m\u2220SPU = m\u2220\u03b3$ | Definition of congruent angles |\n| 5 | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |\n| 6 | $m\u2220VPT = m\u2220\u03b2$ | Definition of congruent angles |\n| 7 | $\u2220UPV\u2245\u2220\u03b1$ | Vertical angles theorem |\n| 8 | $m\u2220UPV = m\u2220\u03b1$ | Definition of congruent angles |\n| 9 | $m\u2220\u03b3 + m\u2220\u03b1 + m\u2220\u03b2 = m\u2220SPT$ | Substitution |\n| 10 | {{field-4}} | {{field-5}} |\n| 11 | $m\u2220\u03b3 + m\u2220\u03b1 + m\u2220\u03b2 = 180^{\u2218}$ | Transitive property of equality |"
